::MODULE{FIELDS|title:每条优惠提取什么}
title price currency offer_url valid_until source_url fetched_at
::MODULE{RUNTIME|title:确定性抓取和渲染}
update_hours: 6
cron: 17 */6 * * *
max_age_hours: 24
timeout_seconds: 20
max_bytes: 5000000
max_pages_per_provider: 3
user_agent: VPSDealsBot/1.0
promotion_pattern: (?i)\b(?:deals?|discounts?|sale|credits?|trials?|money.back)\b|\bsave\s+(?:up to\s+)?[\d$€£]
template_index: index.html
template_provider: provider.html
template_deal: deal.html
template_compare: compare.html
racknerd_plans: [{"memory":"1 GB RAM","annual":"$21.99/Year","pid":"952","specs":"1x vCPU Core; 20 GB SSD; 3 TB Bandwidth","url":"https://my.racknerd.com/aff.php?aff=21233&pid=952"},{"memory":"2 GB RAM","annual":"$35.99/Year","pid":"953","specs":"2x vCPU Cores; 35 GB SSD; 5 TB Bandwidth","url":"https://my.racknerd.com/aff.php?aff=21233&pid=953"},{"memory":"4 GB RAM","annual":"$59.99/Year","pid":"954","specs":"3x vCPU Cores; 60 GB SSD; 7 TB Bandwidth","url":"https://my.racknerd.com/aff.php?aff=21233&pid=954"},{"memory":"6 GB RAM","annual":"$89.99/Year","pid":"955","specs":"6x vCPU Cores; 100 GB SSD; 12 TB Bandwidth","url":"https://my.racknerd.com/aff.php?aff=21233&pid=955"},{"memory":"8 GB RAM","annual":"$119.99/Year","pid":"956","specs":"7x vCPU Cores; 150 GB SSD; 20 TB Bandwidth","url":"https://my.racknerd.com/aff.php?aff=21233&pid=956"}]
::RULE{抓不到 price⇒这条不写 price 字段 也不写进结构化数据 不许拿估的填}
::RULE{valid_until 已过⇒退出当前有效优惠列表 历史页保留并明确失效状态 不许冒充有效}
::RULE{任何来源抓取失败⇒保留历史记录与已发布provider和plan页面 保留原复核时间 标明当前未能重新核验 不计入最新优惠 不删除页面 不跳转首页 保留sitemap入口 不伪造成功时间}
::RULE{试用赠金不是售价 不把 credit 写进 price}
::BOUNDARY{never:编优惠 编价格 编佣金 绕反爬 刷量|scope:permanent}
